        "subject": "Voice gateway (Cloud Run): Sarvam STT + deterministic Marathi khata parser, returns a draft only",
        "body": "Voice gateway (Cloud Run): Sarvam STT + deterministic Marathi khata parser, returns a draft only\n\n- POST /v1/voice-entry: Supabase JWT (JWKS) → audio checks (size, real duration, silence) → shop context\n  (svc_voice_context, cached 10 min) → per-shop rate limit → saaras:v4 + keyterms (retry once v3 codemix) → parser\n- parser: Marathi/Hindi/English amounts incl. she/hajar/did/adich/sava/saade/paune, actions, fuzzy customers\n  (Jaro-Winkler on a phonetic key, top 3), kirana items; config in lexicon.json; p50 3 ms with 2,000 customers\n- errors name the real cause in English + Marathi with request_id; JSON logs + Error Reporting\n- GET /healthz warm-up, /v1/cache/invalidate, /try phone test page (demo shop only)\n- 187 tests (120 transcripts, 45 amount rules, 14 HTTP), Dockerfile (distroless), keyless GitHub → Cloud Run deploy,\n  setup-gcp.sh, README with costs; DB: svc_voice_context (service_role only) + tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W1B8oYQVWxgAdpkxkp4y7z\n",
